*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-04-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 562
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0044.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY PEN0044C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> PENALTY WAIVER FLAG
    05 PENALTY-WAIVED     PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 PENALTY-AMT        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 3000-WAIVER-RULES
    DISPLAY "PENALTY-WAIVED=" PENALTY-WAIVED
    DISPLAY "PENALTY-AMT=" PENALTY-AMT
    STOP RUN.
3000-WAIVER-RULES.
    IF FIRST-LATE-IND = 'Y'
        EVALUATE TRUE
            *> PREMIUM FIRST-OFFENCE WAIVER
            WHEN CUST-TIER = 'G' OR 'P'
                MOVE 'Y' TO PENALTY-WAIVED
                MOVE 0.00 TO PENALTY-AMT
            WHEN DAYS-LATE <= 3
                MOVE 'Y' TO PENALTY-WAIVED
                MOVE 0.00 TO PENALTY-AMT
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF.
